{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Tower Defense game all about strategy, collecting loot and creating fun builds!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/MOD_Tangy_TD_GIF_Unique_Heroes.mov.gif?t=1748607864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tangy TD is all about coming up with different strategies to counter the wide variety of enemies you are going to encounter. Each hero has their own unique set of abilities and <br>items that can be combined into a multitude of powerful builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/MOD_Tangy_TD_GIF_Boss_Battles.mov.gif?t=1748607864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many bosses in the world of Tangeria, each more powerful than the last. <br>Are you up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/Build_Choices.gif?t=1748607864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero has their own skilltree filled with abilities and passives. Currently, there are over 30 unique abilities, and more get added every week!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/Unique_Items.gif?t=1748607864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and collect Normal, Magic, Rare and Epic items with powerful properties to further enhance your abilities and become a weapon of destruction. Or the most powerful healer? <br>The choice is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own (MMORPG-like) party and take down massive Bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Music by: NecropolisAD</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2245620?t=1748607864","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748607864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/e3515b367d1fe762d868315c4b66cc1dfc230ad6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748607864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/e3515b367d1fe762d868315c4b66cc1dfc230ad6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748607864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Tower Defense game all about strategy, collecting loot and creating fun builds!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/MOD_Tangy_TD_GIF_Unique_Heroes.mov.gif?t=1748607864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tangy TD is all about coming up with different strategies to counter the wide variety of enemies you are going to encounter. Each hero has their own unique set of abilities and <br>items that can be combined into a multitude of powerful builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/MOD_Tangy_TD_GIF_Boss_Battles.mov.gif?t=1748607864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many bosses in the world of Tangeria, each more powerful than the last. <br>Are you up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/Build_Choices.gif?t=1748607864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero has their own skilltree filled with abilities and passives. Currently, there are over 30 unique abilities, and more get added every week!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/Unique_Items.gif?t=1748607864\